graphify-out/cost.json
graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/

# Machine-specific MCP client config: absolute paths to a local interpreter, so
# it can never be portable across machines. See CLAUDE.md for how to write one.
.mcp.json

# Packs built here are a developer's own workspace, not part of the tool. A pack
# lives in whatever directory its owner runs `ef` from, and ef scaffolds this same
# rule there — where raw/ and notes/ are deliberately tracked, since fetched
# content suffers link rot and notes are original work.
experts/
